    "startOnNewPage": false,
    "content": "<p>Backend Python developer in Málaga. 2+ years of professional work (EY, ops roles, and a software internship). I build REST APIs with FastAPI, PostgreSQL, Redis, SQLAlchemy, Pydantic, and pytest. Applied generative AI and NLP: prompt engineering (zero-shot, few-shot, Chain-of-Thought, ReAct), structured LLM extraction, embeddings, hybrid retrieval, and RAG-style grounding. LangGraph.js operator pipelines (typed GraphState, tool calling, Groq), reusable agent skills, context engineering, and cost-aware LLM routing. DAW graduate (Jun 2026), capstone 10/10. Open to remote or hybrid backend and GenAI roles.</p>"
  },
