          "description": "<p>Headless FastAPI API for corporate travel: approvals, immutable double-entry ledger, LLM receipt extraction, hybrid bank reconciliation. Live: reckon-flow.onrender.com/docs</p><ul><li>Generative AI: PydanticAI + Groq structured extraction (schema extra=forbid) as a guardrail against prompt injection; HTTP 202 background jobs; stub provider in CI; retries on rate limits. The model cannot approve or pay.</li><li>Hybrid retrieval: SQL prefilter, RapidFuzz, embeddings, Reciprocal Rank Fusion (RRF). Prometheus /metrics. Python, FastAPI, PostgreSQL, Redis, pytest, CI/CD.</li></ul>"
